<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.AFRICA TELKOM HALF YEAR ATTRIB PROFIT RISES.</title>
<headline>S.AFRICA TELKOM HALF YEAR ATTRIB PROFIT RISES.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Sept 30 1996 </p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)	 </p>
<p>    Attrib profit	   664.20	vs   527.05   </p>
<p>    Pre-tax		 1,073.29	vs   661.46</p>
<p>    Tax			 409.10	vs   134.41 </p>
<p>    Revenue		 7,874.52	vs 6,338.84  </p>
<p>    Operating profit    1,769.90	vs 1,359.81</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
